      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've confirmed that TopazChat Player works on Meta Quest in latest VRChat 2022.2.2p1b.\nThe latency on Quest is as following at Tokyo:\nAudio only from TopazChat Streamer: 2.5 seconds\nAudio and Video from OBS: 3.8 seconds\nIt is not good as PC, so i will write another canny to address this issue.\nThe status of this canny isn't moved but thanks everyone who votes this canny!\nGood day, with music.",
